# Kasina environment variables

Copy to `.env` / `apps/server/.dev.vars` / `apps/web/.env.local` as appropriate.
Never commit real secrets.

## Supabase
SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR_PROJECT.supabase.co
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your-service-role-key
# Prefer direct host for Better Auth if pooler idle drops are flaky:
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres:PASSWORD@db.YOUR_PROJECT.supabase.co:5432/postgres

## Better Auth (server)
BETTER_AUTH_SECRET=generate-a-long-random-string
BETTER_AUTH_URL=http://localhost:8787
APP_URL=http://localhost:3000

# Production:
# BETTER_AUTH_URL=https://api.kasina.et
# APP_URL=https://kasina.et

## Web
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:8787
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=http://localhost:3000

# Production:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://api.kasina.et
# NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=https://kasina.et

## Demo
